cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SegmentEveryForam, please cite this software. Because
  SegmentEveryForam is derived from Segmenteverygrain, please also cite the
  Segmenteverygrain paper listed under references.
title: SegmentEveryForam
abstract: >-
  SegmentEveryForam is a Python package for automated segmentation,
  interactive correction and image-based morphometric analysis of
  foraminifera. It combines a fine-tuned U-Net with the Segment Anything
  Model 2.1 and is adapted from Segmenteverygrain.
type: software
authors:
